        "en": "Weigh the Moon's gravity"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Turn the formula around and a pendulum becomes a gravity meter. Time 20 swings, find T, and work out g. Try the practical on the Moon to measure it yourself."
      },
      "equation": "g = \\dfrac{4\\pi^2 L}{T^2}",
